            "created_at": "2025-09-15T21:09:55.188603+00:00",
            "notes": "95% of the time you should take [Extra Charge](item_a5aa16ee-5a80-4e1b-b585-2c4d12575b7a) here, but if you are having a hard time against fliers  [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424)  [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da)  [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18) it can be worth taking  [Evasive Maneuvers](item_3725ca88-f12a-4a00-8878-4fa39a18a394) as this allows you to consistently hit them with your Concussive Blast.\n\nFor items take [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)  will keep you alive in the skies where most healers are going to struggle targeting you, it also synergises well with the spammy nature of this build. Fill in any leftover points with Ability Power and survivability dependant on the enemy comp.",
