            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-15T21:09:55.188603+00:00",
            "notes": "Here I like to take  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) as the stats it provides are crazy. You will benefit from every facet of it, dramatically improving your survivability while also increasing all of your damage.\n\nAlternatively, you could pick up  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) or  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) for Ability Power greeding. I would personally do this if the enemy has no way to deal with fliers and you are taking little to no damage during rounds.\n\n**IMPORTANT:** If you are completely unable to survive through your ultimate then take  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f). Every single aspect of this item is fantastic on Pharah and if your ultimate is being countered then the drawback is entirely moot.",
