            "created_at": "2025-09-15T21:09:55.188603+00:00",
            "notes": "# Powers\nChoice of Round 5 powers should come down to enemy composition:\n\n## [Evasive Maneuvers](item_3725ca88-f12a-4a00-8878-4fa39a18a394)  is a must if versus a flier.  \n## [Cyclic Salvo](item_624ac709-635c-418c-9848-52720e2bba70)  if you are consistently able to land direct hits.  \n## [Speed Kills](item_2ee0fb37-d15c-4f4c-bac5-26f04794fee9)  if you are ending up using more suppressive fire.\n\n# Items\nSee the massive variety of optional powers here. I need to stress that the choice here is completely dependant on three things: matchup, your points and what parts of Pharah's kit are working best for you. I personally would take   [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e)  by default as this gives 30% into Pharah's most important stats and additionally the 100 Overhealth makes your Ultimate have greater impact.",
